<title>UK: SOCCER-PLAYERS VOTE FOR SHEARER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PLAYERS VOTE FOR SHEARER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>England striker Alan Shearer has been voted Footballer of the Year by his country's players for the second time in his career.</p>
<p>Shearer's performances in Euro 96 and 24 goals for his club Newcastle won him the award ahead of Manchester United's David Beckham who was voted Young Player of the Year.</p>
</text>
